Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:20:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-151: character create choice counters and head
 zoom

- GetCharCustomizationInfo(index) -> position, count: the choices a
  customization button's cycle can reach for the selected race, sex and
  class (same record/flag checks as SetNext*, facial hair capped by
  CharacterFacialHairStyles as SetBeardStyle does).
- SetCharacterCreateZoom(0..1): moves the character-create camera toward
  the character's head attachment; zoom 0 is the stock framing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
